      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Edit a video**\n\n1. The first **HashBidX Video** box makes a clip (the top player shows it).\n2. **Extend / Edit Clip** is set to **edit**: its prompt says what to change. Everything else in the clip stays.\n3. Press **Run**. The bottom player shows the edited clip.\n\nSet **duration** to the length of the source clip. An edit is charged for the new clip and for reading the source clip.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Edit a video**\n\n1. The first **HashBidX Video** box makes a clip (the top player shows it).\n2. **Extend / Edit Clip** is set to **edit**: its prompt says what to change. Everything else in the clip stays.\n3. Press **Run**. The bottom player shows the edited clip.\n\nSet **duration** to the length of the source clip. An edit is charged for the new clip and for reading the source clip.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
